      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ADASITI (4) was thereabouts last time out when second at Albury over 1400m, beaten less than a length. Should be at his peak now. Blinkers go on today and looks a great chance to break a long run of outs. HEART BALM (2) was safely held when fifth last time out over the mile at Wagga. That followed a win at Wagga at the previous outing. Ideally placed and is sure to take a ton of beating. CALLISTEMON (1) strode forward early from her wide draw over 1561m at Morphettville Parks last time before fading in the straight. Will push forward and is among the chances on her best form. KING INCANTO (3) had been performing well until racing below his best last time when fifth over 1300m at Wodonga. Rates well on best figures and has the winkers removed this time. Worth keeping safe. SPECIAL PROPHET (6) has been well below his best in his last two when sent back from wide draws. Is much better than those last two suggest and can bounce back sharply here over this trip. Don't underestimate.",
